n approach</span> <strong data-start="300" data-end="329">30% <span class ="tr_" id="tr_191" data-source="" data-orig="on a dry matter basis">on a dry matter basis</span></strong>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_192" data-source="" data-orig="This makes them an excellent plant-based protein source">This makes them an excellent plant-based protein source</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_193" data-source="" data-orig="especially for vegetarian and vegan diets">especially for vegetarian and vegan diets</span>.</p><hr data-start="432" data-end="435" /><h3 data-start="437" data-end="497"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="2_How_much_protein_is_in_fresh_vs_dried_fava_beans"></span><strong data-start="441" data-end="497">2. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_194" data-source="" data-orig="How much protein is in fresh vs dried fava beans">How much protein is in fresh vs dried fava beans</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="499" data-end="760"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_195" data-source="" data-orig="Fresh fava beans usually contain">Fresh fava beans usually contain</span> <strong data-start="532" data-end="563">8<span class ="tr_" id="tr_196" data-source="" data-orig="–10 g of protein per">–10 g of protein per</span> 100 г</strong>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_197" data-source="" data-orig="while dried fava beans are much more concentrated">while dried fava beans are much more concentrated</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_198" data-source="" data-orig="providing">providing</span> <strong data-start="626" data-end="647">20<span class ="tr_" id="tr_199" data-source="" data-orig="–25 g per">–25 g per</span> 100 г</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_200" data-source="" data-orig="due to lower moisture content">due to lower moisture content</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_201" data-source="" data-orig="This is why dried fava beans are preferred in food manufacturing and bulk supply">This is why dried fava beans are preferred in food manufacturing and bulk supply</span>.</p><hr data-start="762" data-end="765" /><h3 data-start="767" data-end="815"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="3_Are_fava_beans_high_in_dietary_fiber"></span><strong data-start="771" data-end="815">3. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_202" data-source="" data-orig="Are fava beans high in dietary fiber">Are fava beans high in dietary fiber</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="817" data-end="1093">Да. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_203" data-source="" data-orig="Fava beans contain approximately">Fava beans contain approximately</span> <strong data-start="855" data-end="892">5<span class ="tr_" id="tr_204" data-source="" data-orig="–11 g of dietary fiber per">–11 g of dietary fiber per</span> 100 г</strong>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_205" data-source="" data-orig="which supports digestive health">which supports digestive health</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_206" data-source="" data-orig="helps regulate cholesterol levels">helps regulate cholesterol levels</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_207" data-source="" data-orig="and contributes to satiety">and contributes to satiety</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_208" data-source="" data-orig="Their fiber content is one reason they are widely used in functional and health-oriented food products">Their fiber content is one reason they are widely used in functional and health-oriented food products</span>.</p><hr data-start="1095" data-end="1098" /><h3 data-start="1100" data-end="1149"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="4_What_vitamins_are_found_in_fava_beans"></span><strong data-start="1104" data-end="1149">4. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_209" data-source="" data-orig="What vitamins are found in fava beans">What vitamins are found in fava beans</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="1151" data-end="1405"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_210" data-source="" data-orig="Fava beans are rich in">Fava beans are rich in</span> <strong data-start="1174" data-end="1196"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_211" data-source="" data-orig="B-complex vitamins">B-complex vitamins</span></strong>, включая <strong data-start="1208" data-end="1255"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_212" data-source="" data-orig="vitamin B1">vitamin B1</span>, Б2, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_213" data-source="" data-orig="B6">B6</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_214" data-source="" data-orig="and folate">and folate</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_215" data-source="" data-orig="vitamin B9">vitamin B9</span>)</strong>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_216" data-source="" data-orig="They also provide">They also provide</span> <strong data-start="1275" data-end="1302"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_217" data-source="" data-orig="vitamin C and vitamin K">vitamin C and vitamin K</span></strong>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_218" data-source="" data-orig="which play important roles in metabolism">which play important roles in metabolism</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_219" data-source="" data-orig="red blood cell formation">red blood cell formation</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_220" data-source="" data-orig="immune function">immune function</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_221" data-source="" data-orig="and bone health">and bone health</span>.</p><hr data-start="1407" data-end="1410" /><h3 data-start="1412" data-end="1459"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="5_What_minerals_do_fava_beans_contain"></span><strong data-start="1416" data-end="1459">5. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_222" data-source="" data-orig="What minerals do fava beans contain">What minerals do fava beans contain</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="1461" data-end="1712"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_223" data-source="" data-orig="Fava beans contain several essential minerals such as">Fava beans contain several essential minerals such as</span> <strong data-start="1515" data-end="1576">кальций, железо, калий, магний, фосфор, и цинк</strong>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_224" data-source="" data-orig="These minerals support bone health">These minerals support bone health</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_225" data-source="" data-orig="oxygen transport in the blood">oxygen transport in the blood</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_226" data-source="" data-orig="electrolyte balance">electrolyte balance</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_227" data-source="" data-orig="immune function">immune function</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_228" data-source="" data-orig="and overall metabolic health">and overall metabolic health</span>.</p><hr data-start="1714" data-end="1717" /><h3 data-start="1719" data-end="1765"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="6_Do_fava_beans_contain_antioxidants"></span><strong data-start="1723" data-end="1765">6. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_229" data-source="" data-orig="Do fava beans contain antioxidants">Do fava beans contain antioxidants</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="1767" data-end="1984">Да. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_230" data-source="" data-orig="Fava beans contain">Fava beans contain</span> <strong data-start="1791" data-end="1821"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_231" data-source="" data-orig="polyphenols and flavonoids">polyphenols and flavonoids</span></strong>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_232" data-source="" data-orig="which are antioxidant compounds that help neutralize free radicals and may reduce the risk of chronic diseases">which are antioxidant compounds that help neutralize free radicals and may reduce the risk of chronic diseases</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_233" data-source="" data-orig="including cardiovascular and metabolic disorders">including cardiovascular and metabolic disorders</span>.</p><hr data-start="1986" data-end="1989" /><h3 data-start="1991" data-end="2028"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="7_Are_fava_beans_low_in_fat"></span><strong data-start="1995" data-end="2028">7. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_234" data-source="" data-orig="Are fava beans low in fat">Are fava beans low in fat</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="2030" data-end="2297"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_235" data-source="" data-orig="Fava beans are naturally">Fava beans are naturally</span> <strong data-start="2055" data-end="2069"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_236" data-source="" data-orig="low in fat">low in fat</span></strong>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_237" data-source="" data-orig="making them suitable for low-fat diets and heart-health-focused food formulations">making them suitable for low-fat diets and heart-health-focused food formulations</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_238" data-source="" data-orig="Their nutritional profile combines">Their nutritional profile combines</span> <strong data-start="2189" data-end="2230"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_239" data-source="" data-orig="high protein">high protein</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_240" data-source="" data-orig="high fiber">high fiber</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_241" data-source="" data-orig="and low fat">and low fat</span></strong>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_242" data-source="" data-orig="which is particularly attractive in plant-based food development">which is particularly attractive in plant-based food development</span>.</p><hr data-start="2299" data-end="2302" /><h3 data-start="2304" data-end="2381"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="8_Are_fava_beans_suitable_for_food_manufacturing_and_industrial_use"></span><strong data-start="2308" data-end="2381">8. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_243" data-source="" data-orig="Are fava beans suitable for food manufacturing and industrial use">Are fava beans suitable for food manufacturing and industrial use</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="2383" data-end="2643">Да. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_244" data-source="" data-orig="From a supplier’s perspective">From a supplier’s perspective</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_245" data-source="" data-orig="dried fava beans are widely used in">dried fava beans are widely used in</span> <strong data-start="2455" data-end="2543"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_246" data-source="" data-orig="plant protein production">plant protein production</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_247" data-source="" data-orig="functional foods">functional foods</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_248" data-source="" data-orig="snacks">snacks</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_249" data-source="" data-orig="and bulk ingredient applications">and bulk ingredient applications</span></strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_250" data-source="" data-orig="due to their stable nutritional composition">due to their stable nutritional composition</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_251" data-source="" data-orig="high protein density">high protein density</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_252" data-source="" data-orig="and good processing performance">and good processing performance</span>.</p><hr data-start="2645" data-end="2648" /><h3 data-start="2650" data-end="2715"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="9_Do_fava_beans_contain_any_special_bioactive_compounds"></span><strong data-start="2654" data-end="2715">9. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_253" data-source="" data-orig="Do fava beans contain any special bioactive compounds">Do fava beans contain any special bioactive compounds</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="2717" data-end="2936"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_254" data-source="" data-orig="Fava beans naturally contain compounds such as">Fava beans naturally contain compounds such as</span> <strong data-start="2764" data-end="2813"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_255" data-source="" data-orig="choline">choline</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_256" data-source="" data-orig="phospholipids">phospholipids</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_257" data-source="" data-orig="and L-DOPA">and L-DOPA</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_258" data-source="" data-orig="levodopa">levodopa</span>)</strong>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_259" data-source="" data-orig="L-DOPA is involved in dopamine synthesis and is one of the reasons fava beans are of scientific and nutritional interest">L-DOPA is involved in dopamine synthesis and is one of the reasons fava beans are of scientific and nutritional interest</span>.</p><hr data-start="2938" data-end="2941" /><h3 data-start="2943" data-end="3032"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="10_Why_is_supplier_quality_important_when_evaluating_fava_beans_nutrition_facts"></span><strong data-start="2947" data-end="3032">10. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_260" data-source="" data-orig="Why is supplier quality important when evaluating fava beans nutrition facts">Why is supplier quality important when evaluating fava beans nutrition facts</span>?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p data-start="3034" data-end="3316"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_261" data-source="" data-orig="Nutrition values are only reliable when the supply is consistent">Nutrition values are only reliable when the supply is consistent</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_262" data-source="" data-orig="Factors such as">Factors such as</span> <strong data-start="3116" data-end="3193"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_263" data-source="" data-orig="harvest maturity">harvest maturity</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_264" data-source="" data-orig="drying method">drying method</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_265" data-source="" data-orig="moisture control">moisture control</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_266" data-source="" data-orig="and storage conditions">and storage conditions</span></strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_267" data-source="" data-orig="directly affect protein">directly affect protein</span>, волокно, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_268" data-source="" data-orig="and mineral stability">and mineral stability</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_269" data-source="" data-orig="A reliable supplier ensures batch-to-batch nutritional consistency">A reliable supplier ensures batch-to-batch nutritional consistency</span>.</p><hr /><